 to ca. AD 1570-1590, toward the end of your Hawaii2 period."  Between 3 and 6 polities for the revised Hawaii2 period finishing at 1580 CE? Fluctuating between 1/6 and 1/3 of the island? AD.'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2064, 'temperature': 0.2})
