ed a higher authority in the Great Khan. The Ilkhanate saw the return of stability to the region. Over time the Ilkhanate absorbed influences from Persia and the Middle East, becoming less \'Mongol\'.<br>'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2604, 'temperature': 0.2})
